# This repository has no root runtime and no root-owned environment variables.
# Do not combine component credentials in one repository-level .env file.
#
# Use each component's reviewed example and machine-readable variable registry.
# The shared Revenue Desk call runtime owns its function-specific variables here:
# src/zoho-catalyst/revenue-desk-call-runtime/functions/revenue_desk_call_gateway/.env.example
# src/zoho-catalyst/revenue-desk-call-runtime/functions/revenue_desk_call_worker/.env.example
# src/zoho-catalyst/revenue-desk-call-runtime/config/variables.json
#
# Real values belong only in the applicable encrypted platform configuration.
# Never commit a populated .env file, private endpoint, platform identifier, or
# notification destination. Make.com is not part of the approved free-test path.
